    "next_steps": {
      "value": "1. Access your application at: mercado-scraping-alb-598340802.us-east-1.elb.amazonaws.com\r\n2. Initialize the database:\r\n   - Install PostgreSQL client\r\n   - Run: psql -h mercado-scraping-db.c6f0eyuyilnc.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com -U postgres -d cloud -c \"CREATE EXTENSION IF NOT EXISTS vector;\"\r\n   - Import your data: psql -h mercado-scraping-db.c6f0eyuyilnc.us-east-1.rds.amazonaws.com -U postgres -d cloud \u003c ../backend/db_dump.sql\r\n3. Update ECS task definitions with your actual application code\r\n",
